# {{ experiment_name }}/trained_models/

Trained model weights and checkpoints for the {{ experiment_title }} experiment
live here — they are **not** committed. Everything under this directory is
gitignored except this README; training and fine-tuning runs populate it locally.

Model weights are large run artifacts: GlucoFoundry ships the code to produce
them, not the weights themselves.

## Reproducing

Train or fine-tune a model via this experiment's recipe / the forecasting
workflow (`--experiment {{ experiment_name }}`) to populate this directory.

Paths resolve through the experiment path contract
(`src.experiments.registry.get_experiment_paths`), so setting
`GLUCOFOUNDRY_ARTIFACTS_ROOT` redirects large artifacts to external/scratch
storage without moving the versioned `configs/`.
